---
title: Miso Peanut Ramen Bowls
description: A sweet and creamy savory broth ladled into bowls with noodles, crispy crumbled tofu, and fresh veg! These ramen bowls are SO GOOD.
image: https://pinchofyum.com/tachyon/Miso-Peanut-Ramen-Bowls-Square.jpg?fit=225%2C225
tags: ramen, vegetarian, tofu, peanut, miso, dinner, asian-inspired, noodles
prep time: 5 minutes
source: https://pinchofyum.com/miso-peanut-ramen-bowls
author: Lindsay Ostrom
cook time: 30 minutes
time required: 35 minutes
course: Dinner
servings: 4 servings
cuisine: Asian-Inspired
